  /// directory buckets, from directory buckets to general purpose buckets, or
  /// between directory buckets, through CopyObject , UploadPartCopy , the
  /// Copy operation in Batch Operations , or the import jobs . In this case,
  /// Amazon S3 makes a call to KMS every time a copy request is made for a
  /// KMS-encrypted object.
  pub bucket_key_enabled: Bool? = None
  /// A bucket-level setting for Amazon S3 general purpose buckets used to
