  /// pre-existing objects already encrypted with the specified encryption
  /// type. For more information, see Blocking or unblocking SSE-C for a
  /// general purpose bucket . Currently, this parameter only supports
  /// blocking or unblocking server-side encryption with customer-provided
  /// keys (SSE-C). For more information about SSE-C, see Using server-side
  /// encryption with customer-provided keys (SSE-C) .
  pub blocked_encryption_types: BlockedEncryptionTypes? = None
}

